<h2 class="mt-6">Features</h2>
<div class="l-ui-grid mt-4">
  <div class="l-ui-surface flex items-center gap-4">
    <%= image_tag "layered_ui/icon_code_bracket.svg", class: "l-ui-icon l-ui-icon--xl", alt: "", aria: { hidden: true } %>
    <div>
      <h3>Skip the boilerplate</h3>
      <p>Declare your resource and route - get index, show, create, update, delete, search, sort, and pagination for free.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="l-ui-surface flex items-center gap-4">
    <%= image_tag "icon_paint.svg", class: "l-ui-icon l-ui-icon--xl", alt: "", aria: { hidden: true } %>
    <div>
      <h3>Looks right out of the box</h3>
      <p>Tables, forms, and pagination come pre-styled via <a href="https://github.com/layered-ai-public/layered-ui-rails">layered-ui-rails</a> with WCAG 2.2 AA compliance and dark mode included - customize as you need.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="l-ui-surface flex items-center gap-4">
    <%= image_tag "icon_wrench.svg", class: "l-ui-icon l-ui-icon--xl", alt: "", aria: { hidden: true } %>
    <div>
      <h3>Override only what you need</h3>
      <p>Swap a single view partial, or subclass the controller to customize one action - the rest keeps working.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="l-ui-surface flex items-center gap-4">
    <%= image_tag "icon_eject.svg", class: "l-ui-icon l-ui-icon--xl", alt: "", aria: { hidden: true } %>
    <div>
      <h3>Eject if you outgrow it</h3>
      <p>Generate the full view templates into your app to rewrite the markup wholesale - and keep reusing the layered-ui components you still want.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
